WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:04.750
Build a resume for the role. Turn the job description into a focused resume that makes your strongest evidence easy to find.

00:00:04.750 --> 00:00:09.500
Step 1. Name the target. Choose one role and pull out the skills, outcomes, and language the employer repeats.

00:00:09.500 --> 00:00:14.250
Step 2. Match evidence to needs. Select experience that proves you can solve the problems this role is hiring for.

00:00:14.250 --> 00:00:19.000
Step 3. Lead with impact. Start bullets with the action, then show the result with a number or clear outcome.

00:00:19.000 --> 00:00:23.750
Step 4. Make it easy to scan. Use direct headings, consistent dates, and enough white space to find key details quickly.

00:00:23.750 --> 00:00:28.500
Final check. Run the ten-second test. A quick scan should reveal your target, strongest proof, and most relevant skills.
